 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "få o have · Getting and having",
     "texto": [
      "**have** = to have (you already have it).\n**få** = to receive, to get, to come to have.\n\n- Danmark **har** en grundlov. → has it\n- Danmark **fik** en grundlov i 1849. → got it\n\nFood and drink: **få**: Jeg **fik** en kop kaffe = I had a cup of coffee.\n⚠️ «Jeg havde en kop kaffe» sounds like you *owned* a cup. 😄"
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Expressions with have",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Danés",
       "lengua": "estudio"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
